      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `9a137a158a64c0171984e41211c9f700a7b2ddc0de1e4b6bd4d77066f0f61b5d--45130DO003_200607.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Criminal Courts, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2006-07\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 14 of 14\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 4c1433d79dd19b77ac0de7790820a07a10ee49c24fe5929fc9d63d1f20ed68c2 | missing |\n| \"Table 1\" | 65df8d62292e09a01ad7c78fd748b7a5360a2981c5a1418d263b8a6663df0378 | missing |\n| \"Table 2\" | dd4f11290b1d5c221576034742d79c2c9aafcbef15f254feb3c9568fac0ca13e | missing |\n| \"Table 3\" | deb24b74486f23c0bc01587ab60d42a4322e0ce1b876390e5a0943c5e2921b55 | missing |\n| \"Table 4\" | 3905fc68052e81c6e66a1e75ee80f865fb5be48667f42e64b286ac44da397f32 | missing |\n| \"Table 5\" | 4625da06b816b587d5857a2f14d9869a4cc7dc2d547dfbfd4c492d1b66bfee4d | missing |\n| \"Table 6\" | b91a1864fa4de8a4febba31ef12036d72221a0b3add6d5bfcf49e0ab4acbaa10 | missing |\n| \"Table 7\" | 314afbe998753ce3345da6f5561233f287bf5592e40272ff48be8cc9b947a84a | missing |\n| \"Table 8\" | c922195ee289e4061a74589782be78b5c45d75611efdba8ce0bf37bc3a9b41a8 | missing |\n| \"Table 9\" | bc3a547266f6cce8d6c324ac95f057a9b0c0cdc3994af50d16fc03862ded910d | missing |\n| \"Table 10\" | f014cf294a033ec9da4dc85371bb16b5da6e2c9e65495e5e7b46a0412076f56a | missing |\n| \"Table 11\" | 201a62e33eeabe9431e7eaaef3312f1af8f444c4d343cbe5cb29dca2c866fdf1 | missing |\n| \"Table 12\" | fe6a079e785424bfc73c07bad637c00102bfafc60785bdba045da73a00657f03 | missing |\n| \"Table 13\" | 3d8fc33dd8979aeb2b068b5bce4f67387c881b1f4965c29526aab3d32b7c62e5 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a 